sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor C as Client
participant DMS as DeliveryManagementSystem
participant R as r:DeliveryRequest
participant P as p:OnlinePayment
participant G as PaymentGateway
participant N as NotificationService
C->>DMS: respondToQuote(r.id, accept, ONLINE)
DMS->>R: acceptQuote(ONLINE, now, client)
R->>R: QUOTED -> ACCEPTED
R->>N: onStatusChange(ACCEPTED)
R->>P: createPayment(ONLINE) - amount = quote.fee
C->>DMS: payOnline(r.id)
DMS->>P: settle(gateway, now)
P->>G: charge(paymentId, amount)
G-->>P: PaymentDeclined
P-->>C: error shown, status stays DUE
C->>DMS: changePaymentMethod(r.id, CASH_ON_DELIVERY)
DMS->>R: changePaymentMethod(COD)
R->>R: replace with c:CashOnDelivery (DUE)
Note over R: request stays ACCEPTED and can still be allocated, the driver collects cash at drop-off
